---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/fishing.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- alice casts north: the float lands 6 m out, on the pond; bob sees it
@1000 conn#4 sends Cast
   -> send conn#4 Fishing
   -> send conn#8 Fishing
-- 10 s later a fish bites
@11000 tick
   -> send conn#4 Ping
   -> send conn#8 Ping
   -> send conn#4 Fishing
   -> send conn#8 Fishing
-- she reels in 2 s later: the carp, the bait gone, the pole a point up
@13000 conn#4 sends ReelIn
   -> send conn#4 ItemSet 1:94 2401x1
   -> send conn#4 Fishing
   -> send conn#8 Fishing
   -> send conn#4 ItemSet 1:1 2421x1
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You caught a Pond Carp!"
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Your fishing pole has 1 of its 2 points."
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 caught item 2421
